Article 2 (Duties of the Committee) The Committee shall deliberate and resolve the following matters: <Amended on September 28, 2020>
1. Matters concerning the formulation and overall management of public defense policies and master plans;
2. Matters concerning standards and procedures for selection, remuneration, management, and supervision of public defenders;
3. Matters concerning standards and procedures for appointment, dismissal, remuneration, management, and supervision of attorneys exclusively responsible for public defense;
4. Matters concerning support for expenses necessary to perform public defense services;
5. Other matters concerning the operation and improvement of the public defense system.
